{
  "name": "Secret Identity",
  "type": "perk",
  "img": "icons/sundries/documents/document-sealed-signatures-red.webp",
  "system": {
    "type": "general",
    "description": "<p>By day you have an ordinary life, and you work hard to keep it. Your Cover starts at 5. While it holds and you wear no mask, your Deception Tests have Edge. When the GM decides you slipped - seen unmasking, a vehicle followed home - you lose 1 Cover; at 0 your identity is blown. Once per mission, lying low restores 1.</p><p><em>M.A.S.K. homebrew.</em></p>",
    "source": {
      "book": "M.A.S.K. (homebrew)",
      "page": 0
    },
    "selectionLimit": 1,
    "rules": [
      {
        "type": "Pool",
        "label": "Cover",
        "key": "cover",
        "max": 5,
        "reset": "none"
      },
      {
        "type": "RollModifier",
        "label": "Secret Identity",
        "edge": true,
        "when": [
          "skill:deception",
          "calc:@pool.cover>0",
          "not:self:slotEquipped:mask"
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Use",
        "label": "Cover slips (GM's call)",
        "cost": {
          "resource": {
            "pool": "cover"
          },
          "amount": 1
        },
        "steps": [
          {
            "do": "chat",
            "text": "{name}'s cover slips."
          },
          {
            "do": "require",
            "check": [
              "calc:@pool.cover>0"
            ],
            "message": "Cover blown - V.E.N.O.M. knows who this agent really is."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Use",
        "label": "Lie low (restore 1 Cover)",
        "limit": {
          "per": "mission",
          "max": 1
        },
        "steps": [
          {
            "do": "gainResource",
            "resource": {
              "pool": "cover"
            },
            "amount": 1
          },
          {
            "do": "chat",
            "text": "{name} lies low and shores up their cover."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "automation": {
      "status": "partial",
      "notes": "<p>Pool: Cover, 5. Automatic: Deception Tests have Edge while Cover is above 0 and you wear no mask. Use buttons: lose 1 Cover (a chat warning when it reaches 0), and once per mission restore 1.</p><p>Left to the table: when the cover slips.</p>"
    }
  },
